          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ধাক্কা — dhākkā — \"a jolt; a collision\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "আস্তে না চালালে ধাক্কা লাগবে। āste nā chālāle dhākkā lāgbe. If you don't drive slowly, you will crash into something."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ধাক্কা (dhākkā) লাগা, to collide; ধাক্কা (dhākkā) দেওয়া, to push or bump into."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ধাক্কা (dhākkā) is filed in CDIAL 6701 under a Middle Indo-Aryan dhakk-, 'push, strike', which lists Bengali dhākkā, 'a push'."
            }
          ]
        },
